<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Feb trade surplus 367.2 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Feb trade surplus 367.2 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia had a trade surplus of 367.2 million ringgit in February against a revised deficit of 102.9 million in January, the Statistics Department said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>		     MALAYSIA TRADE BALANCE</p>
<p>		     (in billions of ringgit)</p>
<p>		     February 1997	February 1996</p>
<p>Trade balance	 +0.36		  -0.736</p>
<p>Exports		 13.51		  13.008</p>
<p>Imports		 13.15		  13.744</p>
</text>
